{title: Shout to the Lord}
{song_number: 30}
{language: en}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[A]My Jesus, [E]my Saviour, [F#m]Lord, there is [E]none like [D]You.
All of my days [A]I want to praise
the [F#m]wonders of Your [G]mighty [Esus4]love. [E]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[A]My comfort, [E]my shelter, [F#m]tower of [E]refuge and [D]strength.
Let every breath, [A]all that I am,
never cease to [G]worship [Esus4]You. [E]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]Shout to the Lord, [F#m]all the earth, let us [D]sing.
[A]Power and majesty, [F#m]praise to the [Dmaj7]King. [Esus4] [E]
[F#m]Mountains bow [D]down and the seas will roar
at the [F#m]sound of Your [E/G#]name. [E]
I [A]sing for joy [F#m]at the work of Your [D]hands. [Esus4] [E]
For[A]ever I'll love You, [F#m]forever I'll [Dmaj7]stand. [Esus4] [E]
[F#m]Nothing compares [D]to the promise [E]I have in [A]You.
{end_of_chorus}
